{%- comment -%}
BLACK WEEK 2026 · gift line in the cart drawer (board 10): "Gratis stålflaska till de första 100 beställningarna."
Static info line, NOT a cart item (the cart cannot know if the order is among the first 100).
Rendered by sections/cart-drawer.liquid when the cart has items; hidden in the presale phase.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="bw-cart-gift{% render 'bw-only', phases: 'early live sidste' %}" style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
  <div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#f8f8f8;flex:none">
    {%- assign bw_gift_img = images['427_496bbe8d-72cc-421a-9db6-f83a5b270081.png'] -%}
    {%- if bw_gift_img != blank -%}
      {{ bw_gift_img | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Arox stålflaska 1,06 l', style: 'width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block' }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;color:#fff">Gratis stålflaska till de första 100 beställningarna.</div>
</div>
